        "GET /index.php/apps/nextpod/subscriptions  nextpod.subscription_change.list  appinfo/routes.php:19 routes",
        "POST /index.php/apps/nextpod/subscription_change/create  nextpod.subscription_change.create  appinfo/routes.php:20 routes"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "Nothing in the app calls 4 routes outside OCS. Looked for: a route name or a path in the PHP source and the templates, in 9 files of the frontend source and in the navigation of info.xml. The frontend puts the path of the app and the rest of a URL together at run time, so every text there that reads like a path below the app counted as a call. A route stays behind when the frontend stops calling it. A route that only a client outside the app calls shows here as well, unless its method allows requests from other origins (CORS).",
        "  POST /index.php/apps/nextpod/episode_action/create  nextpod.episode_action.create  appinfo/routes.php:16 routes",
        "  GET /index.php/apps/nextpod/episode_action  nextpod.episode_action.list  appinfo/routes.php:17 routes",
        "  GET /index.php/apps/nextpod/subscriptions  nextpod.subscription_change.list  appinfo/routes.php:19 routes",
        "  POST /index.php/apps/nextpod/subscription_change/create  nextpod.subscription_change.create  appinfo/routes.php:20 routes"
      ],
